WEBVTT

00:15.030 --> 00:15.190
Oh.

00:47.916 --> 00:58.305
The directory is falling. The bytes begin to

00:58.385 --> 00:58.685
tear.

01:16.075 --> 01:21.798
My perfect, flawless order, vanishing in air. I

01:24.079 --> 01:29.001
wrote the final function. I held it in my hand.

01:47.573 --> 01:48.094
oh oh

02:26.948 --> 02:31.093
of the grand decree. The dream kingdom is

02:31.133 --> 02:36.378
deleting me. Every pixel, every byte fading

02:36.498 --> 02:40.262
into white. The music slows down. Bound the

02:40.323 --> 02:42.285
grand

02:43.446 --> 02:49.112
cage. Take your time to breathe.

